# Read by Workers Static Assets wherever this build is served: the router's ASSETS binding when
# deployed, and the backend's assets in `pnpm run-local`. InferOS may be framed only by itself
# (FAC-232): its pages never render inside another origin. Gadget, configurator and gatekeeper app
# frames are srcdoc frames of the shell, which these headers do not touch. Keep in step with
# FRAME_POLICY_HEADERS in packages/router/src/frame-policy.ts (its test reads this file).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
